  "ruleText": "Saf-C 4803.02 Applicability. Any person licensed pursuant to RSA 146-A:11-b and Saf-C 4303 shall be liable for the payment of fees assessed under RSA 147-B:12 and RSA 146-A:11-b, II.\n\nSource. #9380, eff 1-30-09 (from Saf-C 4802.02); ss by #10022, eff 11-9-11; ss by #13039, eff 4-20-20",
